    {
      "post_id": "552844643097120768",
      "text": "I'm a Muslim journalist. Although I disagree w/ anti-Islam cartoons, my faith compels me to respect the rights of others. #JeSuisCharlie",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 15:10:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552858729188978688",
      "text": "@_JackCharlie I'm not. I'm just tired of people accusing 1.2B Muslims for \"not condemning terrorism\" even when we always have condemned it.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:06:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5285796639186944e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552861590236975104",
      "text": "I'd like if Sarah re-tweeted #CharlieHebdo cartoons @_JackCharlie to show true condemnation and support of the free press @sarah_harvard",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:17:29 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52859845083562e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552845914038349824",
      "text": "@sarah_harvard How can people \"disagree with cartoons\"? It's a cartoon for pete's sake, toughen up.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 15:15:11 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528446430971208e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552854758428786688",
      "text": "@sarah_harvard Glad you're able to make this all about you. #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 15:50:20 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528446430971208e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552856236623147010",
      "text": "@sarah_harvard You are not condemning terrorism. You are pedestaling yourself for your \"Islam\" which is the right kind, of course.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 15:56:13 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5285598302295654e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552862505933234177",
      "text": "Your first obligation Sarah @sarah_harvard is to be \"tired\" of Islamic terrorism itself. @_JackCharlie #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:21:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528587291889787e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552857197634654208",
      "text": "Condemning @sarah_harvard means talking about the reality of Islamic violence on behalf of your slain journalist colleagues. #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:00:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5285598302295654e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552859561003339776",
      "text": "@sarah_harvard once again you use \"we\" your religion segregates your 1.2bn from normality and humanity , I'm not a racist , I'm a realist",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:09:25 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528587291889787e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552855606743560193",
      "text": "@sarah_harvard You are not condemning. You are bragging about your superior ethics.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 15:53:42 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528552784511754e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553015379962785792",
      "text": "@johnleask @sarah_harvard No, you're thinking of an 'opinion'. You can't disagree with an idea.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 02:28:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529731185960837e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552857966391869440",
      "text": "@sarah_harvard that's a pretty basic thing, just because you're a Muslim doesn't put you on higher ground to everyone else , #wakeup",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:03:05 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528446430971208e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552973118596083712",
      "text": "Same way you disagree with any idea MT @English3212: @sarah_harvard How can people \"disagree with cartoons\"? It's a cartoon for pete's sake",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 23:40:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528459140383498e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552857995714256896",
      "text": "In fact Sarah @sarah_harvard openly complaining or remarking on Islamic terrorism puts a person at risk for revenge murder. #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:03:12 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528552784511754e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552855192992251904",
      "text": "But @sarah_harvard can you have an intellectual as well as civil chat about the violent trends within Islam itself? #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 15:52:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528446430971208e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552990284527984641",
      "text": "@_JackCharlie @sarah_harvard really? Are all the \"Christians\" as \"segregationist\"?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:48:52 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528595610033398e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552860963104653312",
      "text": "It's the typical \"Not MY Islam. My Islam is better.\" non-condemnation of Islamic terror. @_JackCharlie @sarah_harvard",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:14:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52859845083562e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
